 "remarks": "Beautiful and quiet two bedroom, three bath condo in downtown Greenwich, CT with new 2024 hardwood floors installed. Incredible location with a 5 minute walk to the parks, ferry, train, playgrounds, shops and restaurants. This Condo has its own attached two-car garage plus an additional outdoor parking space, for a total of three parking spots. Features include central air conditioning, new hardwood floors, living room with fireplace, dining room with French doors leading to a private outdoor patio for relaxing and barbecuing, and yard. Updated kitchen with stainless steel appliances, quartzite countertops and hardwood floors. The 2nd floor has 2 en-suite bedrooms including the primary with walk-in closet. This unit has a washer/dryer and lots of storage. Conveniently located! A pleasure to show!",
